      "description": "Drawing on a white plate over a title and meta row; lifts on hover.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 80\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1D1D1F\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"20\" width=\"60\" height=\"40\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"40\" r=\"12\"/><path d=\"M90 30l18-10M98 22h8\"/></svg></div><div class=\"ds-cbody\"><small>Mechanical · US 6,123,456</small><h3>Folding bicycle frame hinge</h3><p>A hinge that locks the frame rigid without tools.</p></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{max-width:300px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3E3E8;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .35s cubic-bezier(.25,1,.5,1),box-shadow .35s cubic-bezier(.25,1,.5,1)} .ds-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 12px 32px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.12)} .ds-fig{aspect-ratio:4/3;padding:18px;background:#fff} .ds-cbody{display:grid;gap:6px;padding:16px 18px 18px;border-top:1px solid #E3E3E8;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',Inter,sans-serif} .ds-cbody small{font-size:13px;color:#6E6E73} .ds-cbody h3{margin:0;font:600 19px/1.22 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Display',Inter,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-0.022em;color:#1D1D1F} .ds-cbody p{margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.42;color:#6E6E73}"
